cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Reusable Async Analysis Service Pipeline
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-05-26"
license: EUPL-1.2
repository-code: https://github.com/RitAreaSciencePark/sem-classifier-api
abstract: >
  A modular, reusable framework for asynchronous model serving on Kubernetes,
  built on BentoML, Redis, KrakenD, and PostgreSQL. The architecture decouples
  generic async queue orchestration, modality-specific input handling, and model
  inference into independent layers, enabling any non-LLM inference workload to
  be deployed by replacing only the model-specific component. Ships with a
  Hugging Face ViT SEM (Scanning Electron Microscopy) image classifier as its
  reference implementation, deployed for the NFFA-DI Digital Ecosystem at
  AREA Science Park.
